OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'inspirational'
OL,4,AOlympian Ciara Mageean after death at
OL,5,A34
OL,6,
OL,7,FTributes have been paid to former
OL,8,FEuropean champion and two-time Olympic
OL,9,Frunner Ciara Mageean, who has died at
OL,10,Fthe age of 34.
OL,12,FMageean, from Portaferry in County
OL,13,FDown, was diagnosed with stage four
OL,14,Fbowel cancer in May 2025.
OL,16,FShe died on Sunday morning, surrounded
OL,17,Fby her loved ones, a statement posted
OL,18,Fon her social media accounts said.
OL,20,F"A beloved daughter, sister, wife,
OL,21,Ffriend and inspiration to so many, she
OL,22,Fwill be deeply missed," it said.
